From: nomorecoolnicknames <78512247+nomorecoolnicknames@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 14:07:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: add Meizu M6 Note (m1721) HX8399C TCL panel driver

Add a video-mode DSI panel driver for the 1080x1920 Himax
HX8399C-based TCL panel of the Meizu M6 Note (m1721). The driver was
generated with linux-mdss-dsi-panel-driver-generator from the vendor
device tree and converted to the multi-context DSI helpers.

Signed-off-by: nomorecoolnicknames <78512247+nomorecoolnicknames@users.noreply.github.com>
Assisted-by: Claude (Anthropic)
